                              |GKBCRANE DANCE
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'The best way to not be struck after a battle has ensued is to
attack from all directions.'|WKO - |RKBMaster Chan|WKO

|YKOThe graceful Crane form is lithe enough to swim through the
field of battle unhindered. The Monk flows gracefully from
stance to stance battering their enemy from all sides in an
